    "occupation": "Count helper increments eligible denominator and occupied numerator separately. Q100000 ratio plus occupied*per_barony_scale, multiplied by side CB scale, clamped to 0..CB cap, then conditional enemy capital bonus and truncation toward zero. Full-occupation flag can replace all components with +/-100.",
